From 632dad12f6198a11a1c4e0dadd150df1214af428 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christian Hewitt <christianshewitt@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 19:19:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 145/210] arm64: dts: meson: gx: index the HDMI codec DAI

hdmi_tx has an I2S and an S/PDIF DAI, so a link must say which one it
uses. Add a sound-dai cell to the node and name the I2S DAI in the
existing links.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5
Signed-off-by: Christian Hewitt <christianshewitt@gmail.com>
